# Base rules for this lab, not inherited from a generic template. This edition
# ships no workstream, so most entries below are precautionary — set once here
# so a future workstream's build output is excluded by default rather than by
# someone remembering to add a rule after the fact.
# gen: c5f95892b45ff548
#
# One thing this file deliberately does NOT ignore: the status registers.
# `RAID.md` and `current_status.md` are published on purpose, once a
# workstream ships one; see `CURATION.md`.

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# Tooling caches
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/

# Test and coverage output
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
coverage.xml

# Generated artefacts. Anything reproduced by running a workstream's own
# tooling is excluded rather than committed, so a reader is pointed at the
# reproduction command rather than a copy that can go stale.
*.log

# Local environment. Nothing in this edition needs a committed one; excluded
# by default for whatever a future workstream adds.
.env
.env.*

# Editors and operating systems
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
